description:
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, the velocity of our software development is a critical part of our competitive advantage. Our ability to compete depends on how quickly new ideas can move from insight to production. The Developer Experience team is a strategic engineering function with a clear mandate: improve the development lifecycle across the company in ways that accelerate delivery and reduce our time to market. We build the tools, systems, and platforms that shape how software is developed at Optiver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Build Platform sits at the heart of that lifecycle. Every change an engineer makes flows through it. When builds are fast, correct, and reproducible, engineers stay in flow, receive fast and trustworthy feedback, and shipping changes becomes routine. When builds are slow or unreliable, every team in the company pays the tax, one slow feedback loop at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strong engineer with a passion for improving developer productivity, a deep interest in build systems, and the experience to design and operate platforms at scale. You’ll join a growing global Developer Experience team and help shape the future of how software is built, tested, and delivered at Optiver, enabling both engineers and agents to move from idea to production-ready software with greater speed and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of C++ builds at Optiver by designing and rolling out modern build systems that accelerate build times, improve reliability, and create a more consistent developer experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop common build libraries, reusable CI/CD pipelines, and container images used across the company;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build observability into our platform so we can measure performance, reliability and adoption, and use that data to guide further improvements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve build performance at scale through incremental execution, caching, dependency analysis and efficient scheduling;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design workflows that enable agents to compile, test, diagnose failures, and validate changes reliably with minimal human intervention;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering teams to understand where existing workflows create friction and turn those problems into scalable solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams adopt new tools and working practices, balancing standardisation with the needs of different codebases and engineering groups;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends and emerging tools in the developer experience and build systems space, helping guide our adoption of best-in-class solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See the team lead&#39;s opinion on why DevEx matters &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/working-at-optiver/career-hub/why-devex-matters/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong software engineer with deep experience in C++ build systems and developer tooling;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience designing, adopting, or operating modern build systems such as Bazel, Buck2, Pants, or Gradle, ideally including migration from established tooling;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep understanding of build system concepts including incremental builds, caching, reproducibility, dependency graphs, remote execution, and artifact management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are skilled at diagnosing performance and reliability issues across the local development and continuous integration lifecycle, using data and observability to guide improvements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience with CI/CD platforms such as GitHub Actions, Buildkite, Jenkins, or similar, and understand how to design reliable, scalable pipelines and the infrastructure that supports them;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a deep understanding of the end-to-end lifecycle of software development from ideation to deployment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building tools and workflows around source control platforms such as GitHub and GitLab;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about developer productivity and have a track record of delivering meaningful improvements to the software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to continuously improve the market. By providing liquidity and accurate pricing in various financial instruments, to multiple exchanges across the world, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 paid vacation days plus all UK public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily breakfast and lunch, along with support on commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance, pension scheme, and ClassPass fitness membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Please note, we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons. Kindly note that we do not require assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;cc-1sdo59k&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; Find  Jobs in United Kingdom  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Sr. Software Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Team + The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pendo&#39;s engineering teams build the product experiences that help customers understand, improve, and act on product usage data. This team is focused on AI-powered features that turn raw usage signals into automatic, actionable suggestions, reducing the manual work customers need to do before they can get value from Pendo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will help shape and ship intelligent product experiences from discovery through delivery. You will work full-stack with a lean toward frontend, using TypeScript, Vue.js, backend services, and AI coding tools to build high-quality features on a small, fast-moving team. This role also owns product judgment: validating problems with customers, sizing opportunities, defining success metrics, and making pragmatic tradeoffs in ambiguous spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Sheffield office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What this looks like day-to-day&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-powered feature delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and ship features that use AI to turn product usage data into actionable suggestions for customers. You will work end to end across the experience, with attention to quality, usability, and the unique failure modes of AI-backed products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Own delivery across the frontend and backend, with a strong lean toward TypeScript, Vue.js, DOM-level work, component architecture, and in-browser data capture. You will reason about backend services and APIs while building polished, reliable customer-facing experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Help validate problems, shape scope, and test direction before and while building. You will join customer calls, test prototypes, and use real feedback to make sure the team is solving meaningful problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success metrics and iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Define what success looks like for the features you build and use product usage data to guide iteration. You will not just close tickets; you will measure whether the work is creating the intended customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled development:&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI coding tools such as Cursor and Claude Code as a core part of your daily workflow. You will apply strong engineering judgment, review rigor, and accountability to AI-generated code just as you would to your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI product quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Ship AI-backed features with careful attention to latency, hallucination, inconsistent output, and user trust. You will help ensure intelligent experiences are useful, understandable, and reliable for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with product, design, and fellow engineers in a small team where ownership and leverage matter. You will help make pragmatic tradeoffs against ambiguous, fast-moving requirements instead of waiting for a fully defined spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Raise the quality of the team through code review, mentorship, and unblocking teammates. You will communicate clearly, share context, and help others grow while keeping delivery moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the qualifications, we hire through a specific lens. These aren&#39;t buzzwords; they&#39;re the things we&#39;ll actually look for in how you talk about your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a builder, not a maintainer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re most energized when there isn&#39;t a clear path yet, and you get to define it. You don&#39;t wait for direction; you identify gaps, shape solutions, and drive them forward. At Pendo, great Senior Software Engineers don&#39;t just follow instructions; they operate as strategic advisors, influencing decisions, guiding stakeholders, and elevating how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re AI-curious - genuinely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re not using AI tools occasionally. You&#39;re rewiring how you work around them. You&#39;re faster, sharper, and more prolific because of it, and you bring that energy to everything — how you approach your work, how you prep, how you communicate, how you think. We want someone who sees AI as a multiplier, not a shortcut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLMs and AI agents, whether through production work or personal projects. You have built something with these technologies, not just used them as tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack engineering experience with a frontend lean, including strong TypeScript skills, comfort working with the DOM, and the ability to reason about backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building and scaling web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment, including comfort owning ambiguous problems, shaping scope, and making decisions without a fully specified brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining success metrics for a feature and iterating based on real usage data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging directly with customers or end users to validate problems and assess impact after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of software architecture, design principles, and API development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to mentor others, unblock teammates, and support the growth of the engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as, or closely alongside, a product manager, including writing specs, prioritizing a roadmap, or running discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product analytics tools such as Pendo, Amplitude, or Mixpanel to measure feature impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or running experiments, including A/B tests or betas, to validate product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with browser DOM inspection or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Model Context Protocol or building tools for LLM agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with real-time data pipelines or streaming architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessibility experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for continuous learning and sharing insights with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Pendo&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pendo was founded in 2013 by former product managers, who combined their heads and hearts to build something they wanted but never had as product managers: a simple way to understand and attack what truly drives product success. Our mission is to improve society&#39;s experience with software. Come join one of the fastest-growing startups, supported by best-in-class institutions like Battery Ventures, Salesforce Ventures, Spark Capital and Meritech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pendo Core Values:&lt;/strong&gt; Bias to Act, Hone Your Craft, The Team is Pendo, and Maniacal Focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Pendo is a hybrid culture. In-office 3 days per week unless designated remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; The expected salary range for this role to be performed in Sheffield, United Kingdom is £60,000 - £78,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive, top-tier coverage in the United Kingdom, including medical, dental, and life coverage, combined with pension match, equity, and high-value lifestyle perks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEOC:&lt;/strong&gt; We are an equal opportunity employer and believe having diverse teams where everyone brings their whole self to Pendo is key to our success. We welcome all people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Pendo is committed to working with, and providing access and reasonable accommodation to, applicants with mental and/or physical disabilities. If you think you may require an accommodation for any part of the recruitment process, please send a request to: ----- All requests for accommodations are treated discreetly and confidentially, as practical and permitted by law.&lt;/p&gt; Find  Jobs in United Kingdom  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sony Music Entertainment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We’ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We’ve nurtured some of music’s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we&#39;re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music&#39;s Product, Design, Engineering &amp;amp; Global Operations (PDEGO) team is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our engineering team in our London office. Our PDEGO suite powers all of Sony Music&#39;s most critical business capabilities—ensuring monetization, data and analytics depth, marketing and music release at scale for artists across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a technical lead, you&#39;ll help shape the architecture, engineering standards, and long-term technical direction of one of our product spaces at global scale. You&#39;ll work closely with engineering, product, and business stakeholders to modernize systems while mentoring engineers and driving technical excellence across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical design and implementation of scalable software solutions supporting Sony Music&#39;s critical global B2B2C platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architecture decisions across distributed systems, APIs, data pipelines, and platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Operations, and teams of stakeholders to translate complex business requirements into elegant technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, well-tested code while establishing engineering best practices across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design sessions, architecture reviews, and modernization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design resilient services and integrations with internal and third-party platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion application reliability, performance, observability, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through technical coaching, code reviews, and architectural guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical debt and lead initiatives to improve scalability, maintainability, and developer productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues and drive root cause analysis across distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering leadership to define the long-term technical roadmap for the platform you are focused on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seeking &lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of software engineering experience in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Python and JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building frontend applications using TypeScript and React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with various database technologies and query languages (we use Snowflake, MySQL, Neo4j, Kafka, OpenSearch, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing microservices and APIs using REST, HTTP, and OAuth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with AWS cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using log analysis and monitoring tools to investigate production issues and improve reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit, integration, and automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within Agile development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to influence engineering and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for solving complex technical problems and mentoring engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of software architecture, domain modeling, and scalable system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data models and optimizing schemas for complex business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and high-volume systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can mobilize engineering teams around a technical vision and lead execution across multiple initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes engineering best practices, coding standards, and development processes that improve quality and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems-thinking mindset with the ability to balance immediate business needs against long-term platform investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading complex technical initiatives without direct people management responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about mentoring engineers and fostering a culture of technical excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in music, technology, and building systems that directly support artists and creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Hybrid work environment: Our London office is designed for collaboration, offering a balanced hybrid setup (3 days in office / 2 days remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
