&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as Software Engineer in the game industry, using Unreal Engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundation in data structures, algorithms and software methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of version control systems and workflow strategies (GitHub, Perforce/Helix Core, Git-flow, branch management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and comfort working in a collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile game development experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance profiling and optimization experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Unreal Engine 5 version and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
